Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你促成了巴蒂塔斯家那个女人的买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brokered the sale of a woman from the house of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩膀后面有主人家的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of the domina upon the back of her shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find her, brother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是阻止你们重逢的人 格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see everyone that has kept her from your arms to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人当我们是狗 就要他们付出血的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will see the Romans bleed for taking us as dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯是我们共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is enemy to us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙从你眼皮底下溜走多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man takes habit of slipping through your fingers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟哪儿来的信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}what moves you to certainty of victory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是诸神的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the gods themselves will it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于失去荣誉的野兽来说只有一个地方可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is but one place for an animal without honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是带着礼物来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come bearing a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这礼物能助你铲除斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should set you upon path to the fall of spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.26,0:00:57.36,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.86,Title,0,0,0,0,,《多数》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你们的臭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet your fucking bleating!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.27,0:01:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样也能到矿上做工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This how you came for the mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群听不懂人话的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}By not heeding fucking command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己解开锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}See yourselves free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢出其不意啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You favor clever strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻敌人的后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the man from behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今儿开了个好头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good start to the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.15,0:02:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且只会越来越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see it built upon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找一个叫妮维雅的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek a woman named Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴蒂塔斯家灭门之前被赶了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was cast out from the House of Batiatus before its fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是斯巴达克斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Spartacus?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:03:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我旁边那个傻子才是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus stands the fool beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要找的这个女人美若天仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman he seeks is of rare beauty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后有她主人家的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of her domina upon her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被人从…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was carried from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯说剑终有一天能变轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus tells a sword becomes lighter in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人从来不是轻巧的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a heavy thing, to rob a man of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过杀罗马人就另当别论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less so that of a Roman shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去帮忙搬东西 这样才好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will help shoulder weight until we can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her fate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}known to me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.11,0:03:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak it then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一匹马 放我一条生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare a horse, and my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然人手多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They add to our number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,却帮不了我的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet not my cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.43,0:03:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这句话不知道说了多少遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words you have spoken many times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神就是不作理会\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet still ignored by the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人提到了你的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man, he spoke of your woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.59,0:03:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find fucking voice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信她已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe she is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神又一次忽略了最需要他们庇佑的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods again turn from those most worthy of blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我对他没什么好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold no love for the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他如此伤心 我心里也不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet it tears heart, to see him so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did she meet her end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯把她利用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia was put to cart for Lucania{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就扔进了去往卢卡尼亚的马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}having served purpose for Batiatus' ambition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死在矿上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She perished in the mines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受到了折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave life in passage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路上由于伤势过重而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}from injuries borne of mistreatment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:04:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了反而是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death a kindness then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再承受这样的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be spared such a fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得解脱的只有死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kindness only to the one taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是一句话不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man yet stands mute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你送来讨好我的礼物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you would offer me to gain favor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一尊流血的雕塑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A statue that bleeds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯自认为是极重荣誉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus believes himself a man of honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体的痛苦不足以让他出卖弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain alone will not move him to betray his brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know the man well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交到我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given over to my hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh do not think I've forgotten{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都有什么手段 奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}what your hands are capable of, slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是你帮助巴蒂塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or how they aided Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不用收拾这个烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}in tethering me to this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是按照主人的命令办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I but did as my dominus commanded, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不作别的考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}absent thought of refusal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我同样忠心耿耿为您办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I would faithfully serve you now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,势必要斯巴达克斯伏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}in seeing Spartacus brought to his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嘴上说的好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of loyalties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,却还留着巴蒂塔斯家的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the mark of Batiatus brings allegiance to question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体的疤痕而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A blight upon flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,却总是让人怀疑我的企图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever mocking more noble intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就留你一命 看看你究竟有没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And live to see if you are of further use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如您所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要有耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神把奥诺玛默斯送上门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods would not deliver Oenomaus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to mock us with his silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不光怀疑诸神的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sum of my doubt does not lie with the gods alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还怀疑帮他们传达旨意的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's equally shared with their messenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总算露面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Here is our man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是有心 终于想到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courteous to finally acknowledge our presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 我不知道你们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies. I was unaware of your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fault is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到父亲太高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between happy reunion with father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,又忙着跟瓦里留斯打听罗马的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and plying Varinius for news of Rome…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是角斗士训练师的妻子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the lanista's wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,街头巷尾都在议论的幸运之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one they whisper of in the streets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是奥林匹斯诸神的保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a blessing from Olympus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是听从诸神的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am but its humble instrument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太谦虚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are overly modest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,能从那种恐怖浩劫中生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have survived such horrors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是朱庇特明白你的价值所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter himself must have taken note of your worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯是来主持比赛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varinius comes to present games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Games?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为期两周的血腥盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks of blood and sport!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,消除斯巴达克斯的阴影 虽说他尚未伏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}To move the city from heavy thought of Spartacus, yet untamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的手下能出阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shall be glorious spectacle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开幕庆典就相当壮观了\N{\fnArial\fs30}made more so by your men presented in opening celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,威武的士兵外加贵宾席的露迪雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sight of them coupled with Lucretia in the pulvinus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无疑能够安抚民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall help calm the citizenry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到非常荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}An honor, I would happily oblige, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们正在南方忙着剿匪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}were they not otherwise occupied in the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有什么突破性进展吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they draw any closer to their goal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是斯巴达克斯又溜不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or does Spartacus yet elude them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同上次在集市时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I heard he did in the market?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许赛普修斯的手下可以出席你的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Seppius' men could march in your games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,众所周知你对他们的影响力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's well known you hold considerable sway with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛普修斯的手下跟你的不同 不是正规军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seppius' men do not carry the seal of Rome, as your men do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给瓦里留斯上好酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show good Varinius to wine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去观赏城市的迷人风光\N{\fnArial\fs30}and enticing view of the city below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意之极\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would voice no argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证好好地招待你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall see you properly attended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯在元老院备受尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varinius is admired within the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点你要注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing to be carefully considered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到流言蜚语满天飞就来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before words fly from errant fucking tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他难道不是平起平坐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I not stand his equal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,头衔相同罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In title only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为你是没能力的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think you an incompetent child, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,连自己的屁股都擦不干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}unable to wipe clean his own shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以对同级的民政官表现得尊重一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a show of respect towards a fellow praetor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:09:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而平息他人的质疑 不失为明智的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be wise step towards quieting doubt. Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不光是在元老院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only among the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚在北边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua, to the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our current position, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,往东走 到维苏威\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the east, Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安营扎寨的绝佳地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong position to make camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,往南能打庞贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within striking distance of Pompeii to the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者往西北打那不勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Neapolis to the northwest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,战俘都在这里的港口下船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison ships often empty at its ports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被变卖为奴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vomiting men to be sold into slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们兄弟俩就是这样 那是很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my brother and I were, a lifetime ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是从亚得里亚海\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was carried across the Adriatic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再到东部海岸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the eastern seaboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对那不勒斯了解不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know little of Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,带到海岸的都是战士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are fighting men, brought to its shores?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是战俘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captured in foreign wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,天生就是罗马的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already enemies of Rome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易招到我们这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}easily recruited to our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常合理 想法很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reasonable course, well thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去告诉克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall break words with Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他代表高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands for the Gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全都是垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he is waist deep in shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们占到我们的半数 而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are half our number, and much needed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那不勒斯肯定大有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}in any attempt on Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本人也需要从悲伤中走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man himself is in need of distraction from wounded soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么挺过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you survive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你永远失去了心爱的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After your woman was taken from you forever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man that I was did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是行尸走肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am but bones and flesh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了跳动的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}void of beating heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会用罗马人的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will see empty chest filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,填满你空虚的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the blood of Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,血海汪洋也洗不尽我所铸成的大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ocean of it would not wash away what I have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做错什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一心得到妮维雅的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pursued Naevia's affections, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全忽视了暴露的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}regardless of concern towards discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想过如果暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what Lucretia would do if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅的报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}betrayal were known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅因为我的一己私欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia is gone from this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开了人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of my selfish desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱不是我们选择的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not choose love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该来的时候自会到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It claims each man as it will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人无法自拔 直到生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it grips until there is nothing left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.71,0:11:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,空手握起就是拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}An empty hand can yet become a fist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,像妮维雅那样受到束缚的奴隶有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more remain shackled in servitude, as Naevia was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有爱的希望和温存的爱抚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without hope of love or gentle touch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们齐心合力打破枷锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together we can strike chain from neck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就听说过你的这种想法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this subject I have heard your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我静一静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me to my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她曾经充满了活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a radiant spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,却身为奴隶而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet she died a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子也是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fate shared by my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意看到他们这样的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not see more like them fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而明明可以扭转乾坤的人袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because men who could make difference stood idle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,往他心口捅一刀都比他现在好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sword in his chest would be a blow less felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都做出了各自的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have all made sacrifices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到克雷斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus now makes his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would speak with him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话只能带来更可怕的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words would only cause greater suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he knew the truth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你和那些人一起白白送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have you and countless others fall in vain attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那不勒斯的计划还有很多细节没有商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is much planning yet needed towards Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 空虚的目光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that vacant gaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前见过你这种眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've witnessed it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在地下角斗场等待死神降临的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were upon your knees in the Pits, awaiting death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你在渴望死神降临呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or were you longing for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才选择在那样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you sought out a place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无荣耀的地方出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}void of precious honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把强大的奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thought drags the mighty Oenomaus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,带到冥界的深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the depths of the underworld?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 你对这个家族的背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your betrayal of the house that saved you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以免受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}from such torment there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟之盟让你从教练变成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A brotherhood turning your instruction as Doctore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒和凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}to treachery or murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:14:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是阿舒尔从你手下捡回一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that Ashur escaped your attempt to rob him of life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing of low importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大可既往不咎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us set past behind us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,展望未来 不必为此伤和气\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn eye towards less quarrelsome future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, No no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要开口求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must ask for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须打破沉默 开口说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must break silence and speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想喝水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thirst for water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想活下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the release of death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来 就满足你的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free your tongue, and see desires quenched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我斯巴达克斯和那帮杂碎在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where Spartacus and his shits are to be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所坚持的东西 他们根本不屑一顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have spat on everything you've held true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全没必要袒护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe them nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊 该死的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak, you fucking cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就沉默吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain silent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,半死不活地受苦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain living, and in pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,日复一日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day after day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有阿舒尔来慰劳你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With only Ashur to comfort you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你曾在这沙场之上慰劳我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you once comforted me upon these very sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来的事情 你应该告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have warned me of their arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时没想到嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was swept by the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只在那里站了一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stood but a short length waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够让你父亲给我脖子套个活结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough for your father to slip noose about my neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你率军表演 这些都无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}All will be forgotten when you present your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为了看我的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh to honor a jest of a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To honor your child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父亲即将在元老院平步青云\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a father that will rise within the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎瓦里留斯摸过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not care for Varinius' hand upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的抚摸绝不会让我这儿如此湿润\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet his touch will never know wetter climes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没心思 还有工作要做 - 工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pressing concerns pull mind from task. - Task?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.01,0:17:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和马科斯协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must confer with Marcus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,从南边召回我的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards the recall of my troops from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must not fall to quarrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,维苏威非常适合我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vesuvius will serve purpose well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈建议到那不勒斯离河岸不远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron speaks of fighting men to be liberated from Neapolis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,解放被俘的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}not far from it's banks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈只配喝我的尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron can suck the piss from my cock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那玩意儿太小 不够喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too small a drink for a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维苏威有它的优势 - 该死的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vesuvius offers advantage. - Fucking coward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能从后方攻击那不勒斯港口的船只\N{\fnArial\fs30}From its shadow we can strike the ports of Neapolis'…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,救出罗马人抓来关在船上的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}ships heavy with warriors captured by the Romans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟我们以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as many of us once were{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听听克雷斯的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us hear from Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了又有什么用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What words would make difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些自言自语\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones I have told myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones of hope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有美好生活的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and promise of better days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也喊不出空洞的口号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throat can no longer make such empty noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗓子堵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is choked with loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很多人都有相似的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}An agony familiar to many of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.86,0:18:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯痛失爱妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus lost his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他心里的火还在烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet his fire still burns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈 痛失手足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron, a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他心里的火没有灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet his fire still burns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都失去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have all lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都目睹过心爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have all seen those held as friend, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as lover, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,死于罗马人之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}fall to the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们心中的火仍在燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet our fire still burns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们携手同心 就能燃起地狱之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}And together we shall ignite an inferno.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和斯巴达克斯一起去维苏威\N{\fnArial\fs30}I move to Vesuvius with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你弥留之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your final moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你苦求我赐你一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you beg for life's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉我斯巴达克斯和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will tell me where Spartacus and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打到你这张臭嘴说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall tear the words from your fucking mouth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在预言实现之前 奥诺玛默斯不能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus must not die before prophecy is fulfilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就祈求上天撬开他的嘴巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then entreat the fucking heavens to pry his lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者管好你的嘴巴 免得自身不保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you would do well to seal your own, lest tongue escape you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不该回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have returned to this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终没什么好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunes darken as consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神自会给你光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look to the gods for illumination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是朱庇特在你奄奄一息时发现了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it Jupiter, that found you near death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是维纳斯把你的破肚子缝好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Venus, who stitched your mangled womb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是战神给你吃给你穿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Mars see you fed and clothed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是阿波罗把奥诺玛默斯交到你手中 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Apollo deliver Oenomaus into your hands? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿舒尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.15,0:21:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最低贱的凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lowest of fucking mortals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是奉诸神的意志行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You but service the will of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为你做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was serving you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.55,0:21:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我为他们做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.45,0:21:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恐怕我们都被抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I fear that we are both forsaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯开口说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man will not speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他不开口 你的预言就没戏可唱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent his words, your prophecy will fall to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那些信徒也将离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pious quickly to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是死人也有软肋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the dead may give voice to passion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙现在就是一具躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man stands empty of such worldly vice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就给他血肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then see him filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他回忆过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}With memories of the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个深埋于高墙之内的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a secret, buried within these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要将其挖掘出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will see it exhumed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是死尸也会开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the corpse set to purpose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,时辰不早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hour grows late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去暖床吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our bed cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.09,0:22:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会儿就去陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be with you presently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最折磨人的 就是无止境地等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maddening thing, to forever be waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.84,0:23:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离你那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far from your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身边并不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not always the safest place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都有亲身体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}As many have learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她们不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正站在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand with you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅可以抚慰你 满足你的需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would hold more value than gentle touch and satisfying your needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.27,0:23:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会站在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would stand beside you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,手执利刃 沾满罗马人的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}blade gripped in hand slick with Roman blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.37,0:23:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以助你一臂之力 而不像妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not be helpless, as Naevia was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只能慢慢走向死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her life slow march towards death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.27,0:23:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会有这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all move towards such end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是时间长短不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the length of the journey differs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就共赴此约吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let us greet it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,死也要轰轰烈烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And show not all go quietly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.86,0:24:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算把整座宅子都装进箱子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You intend to spirit away the entire villa in that trunk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.46,0:24:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道维苏威那儿有什么呢 夏达娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not know what Vesuvius holds, Chadara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.33,0:24:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈可以帮我们做好补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron would have us well supplied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很有型 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is of a form, is he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.51,0:24:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.61,0:24:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you suppose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.72,0:24:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我没注意你看他的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not think I have not noticed your eyes upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.47,0:24:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不用说后来你们凑在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor the way of late you have been huddled together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.35,0:24:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃窃私语\N{\fnArial\fs30}in intimate conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.89,0:24:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake subject of discussion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.43,0:24:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一靠近你的脸就红 这我可错不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet not the blush upon your cheek when he is near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.46,0:25:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要好好打扮才能博得他的欢心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would do yourself well to pursue desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.45,0:25:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是对我有意思 我就会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would myself, if I believed he favored me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.82,0:25:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是看上莱斯克斯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were taken with Rhaskos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯就是禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhaskos is a base animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.82,0:25:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他挺能打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet one with sharp claws, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.42,0:25:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以保护我 给我地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}offering protection and position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.65,0:25:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯很看重艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus holds Agron in much high esteem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.48,0:25:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真羡慕你跟他那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I envy you his attentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.92,0:25:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们借助运奴车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can reach Vesuvius by nightfall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落前就能到维苏威了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we put the slaver wagon to use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.71,0:25:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,走大路的危险难以预料\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would commit us to the roads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,丛林可以给我们打掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}The forest will better hide our numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.21,0:25:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但走得很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And slow progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓 至少我们能安全到达山区\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fair trade, to see us all to the mountain alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.29,0:25:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.18,0:25:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你训练的时候我没说好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not in favor of your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know the reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.30,0:25:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我刺杀过斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made attempt on Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.70,0:25:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿我也干过 好多次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}As have I, on more than one occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.35,0:25:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.86,0:25:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是叙利亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are Syrian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.13,0:26:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我曾经与一个叙利亚人交恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had unfortunate acquaintance with one of your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.34,0:26:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女人妮维雅也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As did my woman, Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.05,0:26:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.46,0:26:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给她带来了很多痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He caused her much pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.81,0:26:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet despite this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.63,0:26:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不会因为那人的行为对你心存芥蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}she would not have held you for his actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.40,0:26:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本性善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such was her heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.71,0:26:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我应该学习她的一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I shall try to honor, in thought and deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我必须告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something I must tell you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.30,0:26:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人当我们是惹人嫌的苍蝇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome considers us nagging fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.33,0:26:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等去了那不勒斯 他们就明白…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Neapolis, they shall know the sting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.58,0:26:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.83,0:26:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,管好你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.97,0:26:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.20,0:26:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fucking kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.48,0:26:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you lost mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.03,0:26:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regained heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.55,0:26:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪儿听来的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you come by this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.33,0:27:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是纳西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy Nasir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.07,0:27:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那奴隶贩子没说妮维雅已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slaver told not of Naevia's death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.41,0:27:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是她在矿区受苦受难\N{\fnArial\fs30}but of her suffering in the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.22,0:27:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,命该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}An equal fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.88,0:27:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明明不知道她的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you bear false tongue, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.47,0:27:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}when a life holds in the balance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.99,0:27:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们的死活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of our lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.28,0:27:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁管我们的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of our lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.14,0:27:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯满脑子想的都是妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus has no thought towards any but Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.82,0:27:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他愚蠢地攻打矿区\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would have us all meet our end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.43,0:27:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都得送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}in foolish attempt on the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.34,0:27:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能这么做 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what needed to be done, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.31,0:27:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.94,0:27:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.35,0:27:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the greater good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.29,0:27:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你弟弟杜罗命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that would never have passed lips, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.19,0:27:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不会撒这个谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}had it been your brother Duro in her place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:28:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是一条人命可以牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a single life holds no value, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.98,0:28:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的命又有什么价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}then none are of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在克雷斯这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand with Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.09,0:28:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要救出妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will see Naevia from bondage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.07,0:28:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要为这事儿送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not fucking die for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.98,0:28:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去维苏威\N{\fnArial\fs30}I move for Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.65,0:28:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想活命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those that would live, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.28,0:28:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}join me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.98,0:29:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He returns to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.79,0:29:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在寒风的拥抱中 昼夜不眠地守着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have set vigil, throughout chill embrace of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.36,0:29:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么担心我一怒之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concerned that in eruption I had ah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.39,0:29:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你上了西天\N{\fnArial\fs30}released you to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你没离开这个世界 我满心欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It swells heart, to find you yet bound to this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是一言不发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not a word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不说就不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. Save voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.75,0:29:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就轮到我一吐为快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would enjoy the sweet caress of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.82,0:29:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So very much to speak of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.83,0:29:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座宅子多年的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long years of secrets within this house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.81,0:29:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,渗进了每一根房梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeping in the very bones that support it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.43,0:29:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵贴在横木上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place ear to any beam, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些低语声绝对吓你一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and marvel at the whispers of the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.21,0:29:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那里 我初见克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was there that I first discovered Crixus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.33,0:30:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着年轻的妮维雅 坠入悲情的爱河\N{\fnArial\fs30}embraced in ill fated love with the young Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.27,0:30:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 主人答应提高我的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, dominus blessed me with elevation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要干掉行政官克拉维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon heel of ending Magistrate Calavius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.01,0:30:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后栽赃给索罗尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cursing Solonius with the deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.45,0:30:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,更深的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further inside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯染指了你的爱妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Gannicus first took your wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.32,0:30:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为取悦尊贵的瓦鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}as entertainment for noble Varus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,顽石点头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stone at last cracks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.81,0:30:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了帮那个婊子说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In defense of a fucking whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.96,0:30:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没那么蠢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you really so blind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.38,0:30:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对视时缠绵的目光\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lingering gazes they shared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.67,0:30:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那位兄弟微妙的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}The subtle change in your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.51,0:30:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.49,0:30:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不配提起兄弟二字\N{\fnArial\fs30}know nothing of brotherhood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.36,0:30:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯也不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor did Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.87,0:30:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没有扪心自问过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you never asked yourself how your wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.21,0:30:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯准备的毒酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}came to sip a tainted wine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老婆是如何尝到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was meant for Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.92,0:31:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有小偷小摸的习惯 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was not in habit of thieving, was she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.96,0:31:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会独自喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or partaking of drink alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.40,0:31:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得那晚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recall that night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.71,0:31:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯第二天要被转手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus, to be sold the next morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.35,0:31:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟主人去了城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, conveniently removed to town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.61,0:31:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爱妻溜进甘尼克斯的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife, slipping away into Gannicus' cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.07,0:31:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}last…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.54,0:31:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.91,0:31:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的命运如此相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.33,0:31:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus. Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.46,0:31:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,高贵的奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The noble Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.97,0:31:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为别人享用了心爱的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falling to ruin for women plowed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.16,0:31:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己折磨得生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}by other men's cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.47,0:31:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想我说的话是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search heart, and feel the sting of truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.66,0:32:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,本是送给泰塔斯的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was a gift for Titus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么可能品尝到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it come to pass her lips?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会小偷小摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was no thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.66,0:32:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爱妻劈腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife betrayed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.00,0:32:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞了你兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.43,0:32:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他们爱你 其实都背叛了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone you believed to love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.76,0:32:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,狡猾的毒蛇怎能理解真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does a serpent know of love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.63,0:32:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱情正如毒蛇 相当致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That its bite is often fatal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.29,0:32:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爱妻倒在了它的毒液中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife fell to its venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.42,0:32:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒斯巴达克斯的婊子也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As did the traitor Spartacus' bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.46,0:32:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使趾高气昂的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the mighty Gaul saw his heart wither, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.19,0:32:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当妮维雅离开他的怀抱 也是撕心裂肺\N{\fnArial\fs30}when ripe Naevia was plucked forever from his grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.76,0:32:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.78,0:32:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天割开你的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day your fucking throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.33,0:32:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her?{\r}
