Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.04,0:40:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不做妇女就不幸福吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of being sort of other than matron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.83,0:40:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿青春美貌引诱男人 听他们百般奉承\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enticing men until they fawn over your every word, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.00,0:40:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了摸摸你 这样不幸福吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}aching to receive the slightest touch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.72,0:40:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是维系婚姻所必要的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bonds of marriage desired result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.62,0:40:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这么可怕吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it would not be too horrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.88,0:40:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他英俊而又富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he were handsome. And rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.32,0:40:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天只想着抚摸我 这就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thought of nothing but his hands upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.22,0:41:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,欲望之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lust, as all things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.92,0:41:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都随着时间而消退\N{\fnArial\fs30}fades with the passing of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.79,0:41:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳升高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun draws high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就座吧 开始今日比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us fall to our seats, and see day begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.52,0:41:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯说你的手下要登台表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varinius tells that your men are to be presented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.04,0:41:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.89,0:41:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的手下是正规军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The request would have fallen to yours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.08,0:41:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务就落到你头上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they were proper soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.72,0:41:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就等着见识罗马正规军的风采了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look forward to witnessing proper Roman formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.10,0:41:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,市民的情绪也能振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be a pleasant distraction for the people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.80,0:41:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时我的手下去捉拿斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}while my men bring Spartacus to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.44,0:41:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.04,0:41:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的士兵都安排就位了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soldiers are to purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.85,0:41:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.49,0:41:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来发言 瓦里留斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd is yours, Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.76,0:41:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的各位市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good citizens of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.86,0:42:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用这场比赛向罗马的好姐妹致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I present these games to honor the beloved sister of Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.92,0:42:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且传达这样一个信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to send message that her spirit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.73,0:42:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的精神永远不灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall never be quelled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.15,0:42:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图伤害她的暴徒无法得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}by those that seek to cause her injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.54,0:42:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们往后的欢呼喝彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cheers in the coming days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.84,0:42:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹如良药 定能抚慰伤痛的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall serve as balm to wounded heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.35,0:42:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座伟大城市的子民所共同承受的伤痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wound shared by many in this great city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.08,0:42:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪魁祸首则是斯巴达克斯及其杀人团伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}so inflicted by the treachery of Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.43,0:42:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人发指的叛逆行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his murderous horde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.56,0:42:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在此号召罗马之子整装前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call now upon the sons of Rome to march, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.31,0:42:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,步步惊雷 是为宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thunder of their every step a declaration!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.33,0:42:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡与哀痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That loss and grief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.67,0:42:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,终将化为凯旋的狂欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall give way to triumph and joy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.23,0:42:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手下躲哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your fucking men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.06,0:43:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排就位了 我说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set to purpose, as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.99,0:43:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.47,0:43:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.92,0:43:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们奉民政官葛雷博之命前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We come on order of Praetor Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.13,0:43:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人企图破坏矿区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has attempt been made to breach the mines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.01,0:43:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 安然无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}None. It stands secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.55,0:43:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,送话去卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch word to Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.71,0:43:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,此行徒劳无获\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would turn from fool's errand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.01,0:43:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求再去郊区搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}and recommit to sweep the countryside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.86,0:43:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.27,0:43:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know these men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.73,0:43:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼努斯和普莱努斯 角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mannus and Plenus! Gladiators, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.18,0:43:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上有巴蒂塔斯家族的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}bearing the mark of Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.23,0:44:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.44,0:44:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走哪条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way do we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,两条路都能找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both should lead us to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.45,0:44:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one the shorter path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.19,0:44:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,越是接近越不可轻率\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would double odds toward goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.94,0:44:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,走远路 动作轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the longer path. Move quietly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.32,0:44:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.98,0:44:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的瓦里留斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noble Varinius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.24,0:44:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们致歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer apologies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.06,0:44:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵们并未前来列阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not seek to lower spirits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.60,0:44:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是要挫败斗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}with absence of display, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.26,0:44:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而是鼓舞精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}but instead to raise them up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.00,0:44:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的士兵们\N{\fnArial\fs30}With knowledge that my soldiers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.01,0:44:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到诸神的指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been set to higher purpose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.02,0:44:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,前去追寻更崇高的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the gods themselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.70,0:44:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻 他们已逼近斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this very moment, they close on Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.25,0:45:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落之前 他将再次跪倒在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by day's end, he shall once more kneel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.40,0:45:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马的荣光之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the glory of Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.40,0:45:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.25,0:45:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马 罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome! Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.72,0:45:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要给他们自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must see them freed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.59,0:45:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,人数太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are too many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.39,0:45:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被察觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would be discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.39,0:45:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.55,0:45:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有朝一日我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And know I will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.92,0:45:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.38,0:45:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.48,0:46:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.34,0:46:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.67,0:46:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.46,0:46:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他说的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where he said she would be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.98,0:46:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果所言属实的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he spoke truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.68,0:46:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.87,0:46:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有个人 肩膀后有主人家的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one here, with mark of her domina upon back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.03,0:46:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.74,0:46:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.77,0:46:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.35,0:46:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.18,0:46:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safe, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.03,0:46:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.69,0:46:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.00,0:47:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.99,0:47:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.26,0:47:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me for what I have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.94,0:47:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Someone comes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.65,0:47:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤 快撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.18,0:47:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.50,0:47:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.76,0:47:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.63,0:47:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.47,0:48:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.75,0:48:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,且慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.83,0:48:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条地下河\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a runoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.39,0:48:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,通向矿区的另一端\N{\fnArial\fs30}It empties out on the other side of the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.76,0:48:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走哪条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which path do we take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.60,0:48:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.70,0:48:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.90,0:49:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这是把我们往死路上引\N{\fnArial\fs30}She leads us to our fucking death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.04,0:49:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸 找到方向感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take breath, and gain your bearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.98,0:49:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,少转了一道弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A turn missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.07,0:49:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里通向水流所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take us to the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.58,0:49:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.64,0:49:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.56,0:49:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.06,0:49:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.41,0:49:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来拖住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give them pause, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.00,0:49:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就能逃出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you may slip from grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.99,0:49:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two down there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.31,0:49:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证妮维雅的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}See Naevia to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.50,0:49:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.32,0:50:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}See it done, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.53,0:50:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.13,0:50:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.39,0:50:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.60,0:50:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.39,0:50:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这帮畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.60,0:51:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀 杀 杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill, kill, kill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.04,0:51:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.71,0:51:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.97,0:51:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
